      "note": "1889-1901 period is documented for protective canal dams by Rosmorport; the city almanac dates the beginning of the navigable channel works to 1890. Opened on 1901-11-15. Do not treat different definitions of construction start as an exact shoreline switch. The original canal and lagoons' artificial dams predate 1914."
